    <h1 class="metadata main-top-title citation_title" id="idm1433909192">Effects of Sit-to-Stand Exercise combined with Joint Mobilization with Movement on Lower Extremity Functions, Balance, and Gait Performance in Patients with Chronic Stroke</h1>
    <div class="contrib-group"><span class="citation_author">Jimin Gu</span><sup>1</sup>, <span class="citation_author">Tae-ho Kim</span><sup>1</sup><sup>,</sup><sup>*</sup></div>
    <div class="author-button"> Author Information &amp; Copyright <span class="author-aff-toggle-text">â–¼</span></div>
